### Decision

**Yes â€” everywhere an ID is accepted.** Partial matching applies to `--parent`, `--blocked-by`, `--blocks`, and any other flag that takes a task ID. The resolution function is centralized in the storage layer, so all ID inputs go through it. Users will expect consistent behaviour across all ID inputs.

