␀␀␀␀␀Ë?š0␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿q␀␀␀␀␀Ë?†Ø␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¥(␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿Šà␀␀␀␀␀Ë?’\␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Dä␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¡Ø␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¢<␀␀␀␀␀Ë?•0␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¨\␀␀␀␀␀Ë?n␀␀␀␀␀Ë?K\␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¢ ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?šì␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ƒ\␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‘Ø␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿–l␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ƒ0␀␀␀␀␀¢82Š¢idÙOunknown-flags-silently-ignored-specification-unknown-flags-silently-ignored-005§contentÚ[## Error Behavior

When an unknown flag is encountered, the command must fail immediately with a clear error message.

**Error message format:**

```
Error: unknown flag "{flag}" for "{command}". Run 'tick help {command}' for usage.
```

**Examples:**
- `tick dep add tick-aaa --blocks tick-bbb` â†’ `Error: unknown flag "--blocks" for "dep add". Run 'tick help dep' for usage.`
- `tick show --verbose tick-abc123` â†’ *(no error â€” `--verbose` is a known global flag)*
- `tick list --unknown` â†’ `Error: unknown flag "--unknown" for "list". Run 'tick help list' for usage.`

**Two-level commands**: For compound commands, the error uses the fully-qualified name (e.g., `"dep add"`) but the help reference uses the parent command name (e.g., `tick help dep`), since `tick help` only accepts top-level command names.

**Exit code:** Non-zero (consistent with existing error handling)

**Unknown flags before subcommand:** `parseArgs()` currently silently skips unknown flags appearing before the subcommand is identified. These must also be rejected with: `Error: unknown flag "{flag}". Run 'tick help' for usage.`©work_unit¾unknown-flags-silently-ignored©work_type¦bugfix¥phase­specification¥topic¾unknown-flags-silently-ignoredªconfidence¤high«source_fileÙ/Users/leeovery/Code/tick/.workflows/unknown-flags-silently-ignored/specification/unknown-flags-silently-ignored/specification.md©timestampÏ␀␀ßİ‚?©embeddingÜ␀Ë¿r4␀␀␀␀␀Ë?4␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿€␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Ì␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿€␀␀␀␀␀Ë?š␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿«␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿„8␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¬¤␀␀␀␀␀Ë¾ßÀ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?xD␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿$␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿h␀␀␀␀␀Ë>á ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?š˜␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿€␀␀␀␀␀Ë?˜à␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¡(␀␀␀␀␀Ë?“t␀␀␀␀␀Ë?«œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?SÈ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?šĞ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?h␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¡Ø␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‘¸␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¥␀␀␀␀␀Ë?␀␀␀␀␀Ë? x␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¡␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿›¼␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿§P␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‚€␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‘ä␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿}”␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿™p␀␀␀␀␀Ë?ŸÀ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿yÄ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿Ÿˆ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¥ğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿@␀␀␀␀␀Ë?ª¸␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¢␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ŸL␀␀␀␀␀Ë?i|␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿†␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Eğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿`␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‘”␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë?™Ä␀␀␀␀␀Ë?­␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Š␀␀␀␀␀Ë?“␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿rd␀␀␀␀␀Ë?•è␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¯␀␀␀␀␀␀Ë?“ä␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿„ˆ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ˆĞ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿­(␀␀␀␀␀Ë?…¤␀␀␀␀␀Ë?‘„␀␀␀␀␀Ë¾Ñ€␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿†ü␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿”ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿˜<␀␀␀␀␀Ë?­À␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Y␀␀␀␀␀Ë?‘´␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿€`␀␀␀␀␀Ë?• ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿šp␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿rŒ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?©Ü␀␀␀␀␀Ë? ˆ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¡L␀␀␀␀␀Ë?©P␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‚ğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿±ğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ŠD␀␀␀␀␀Ë?’p␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¡Œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿µ´␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿§T␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿(␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¸œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¨0␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¢<␀␀␀␀␀Ë?␀␀␀␀␀Ë?‚Œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¢¼␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿˜D␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿Œ´␀␀␀␀␀Ë?~ü␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿o´␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿’Ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë? ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?mt␀␀␀␀␀Ë?5X␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿”¬␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¡$␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ˆ€␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¥t␀␀␀␀␀Ë?␀␀␀␀␀Ë?§”␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿x¤␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿€ğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?Œ␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿Š|␀␀␀␀␀Ë?–Ü␀␀␀␀␀Ë?›␀␀␀␀␀Ë?}¨␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ H␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‡`␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿pD␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿@␀␀␀␀␀Ë?{␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿X␀␀␀␀␀Ë?€8␀␀␀␀␀Ë?(␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‹°␀␀␀␀␀Ë?˜␀␀␀␀␀Ë?P␀␀␀␀␀Ë?È␀␀␀␀␀Ë?’␀␀␀␀␀Ë?d„␀␀␀␀␀Ë?š¨␀␀␀␀␀Ë?›P␀␀␀␀␀Ë?‘È␀␀␀␀␀Ë?ƒ<␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿¡è␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿@␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿T”␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¤ô␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿­␀␀␀␀␀Ë?¦␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ ´␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿•ˆ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?L␀␀␀␀␀Ë?‡@␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‡¤␀␀␀␀␀Ë?•␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿p°␀␀␀␀␀Ë?IP␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ü␀␀␀␀␀Ë?§t␀␀␀␀␀Ë?pœ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?§,␀␀␀␀␀Ë>û␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿²@␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿‚L␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿šx␀␀␀␀␀Ë?’␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿sà␀␀␀␀␀Ë?šP␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿rT␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿šğ␀␀␀␀␀Ë?ª␀␀␀␀␀Ë¿ƒ␀␀␀